release-plz 0.4.3 lists the commits of the packages in changelog_include only for a package with a
release tag: before the first vX.Y.Z tag, CHANGELOG.md misses the PRs that change only a crate.
This patch lists them before it too, and versions the build 0.4.3+skald.1. script/install-release-plz
applies it to the sources of release-plz 0.4.3 and release_plz_core 0.43.0 from crates.io.

